  "goodToKnow": "Das Altertum is antiquity, especially Greek and Roman: im Altertum, die Völker des Altertums. A synonym is die Antike. It's followed by das Mittelalter (Middle Ages) and die Neuzeit. The plural die Altertümer means antiquities, ancient objects. Altertümlich means archaic, and die Altertumswissenschaft is classical studies. Germany's Roman Limes border wall is a UNESCO World Heritage site."
